# ============================================================
# Public portfolio .gitignore (professional, curated).
#
# Policy: publish ONLY clean, lab-related writeups and the
# polished evidence that supports them. Everything internal
# (journals, tracking logs, scratch, planning, the study vault)
# stays private.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the top level by default, allow
# the two artifact folders, then trim the internal bits back out.
# ============================================================

# 1) Ignore every top-level entry by default.
/*

# 2) Repo meta files.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# 3) Allow the two artifact folders (contents come along, then
#    get trimmed by the exclusions below).
!/00_parrot-hardening/
!/01_SIEM-Detection/

# 4) Keep INTERNAL / process / tracking / scratch material OUT,
#    even inside the allowed artifact folders:

#    Lab journals, screenshot logs, evidence indexes
**/journal.md
**/SCREENSHOT-LOG.md
**/EVIDENCE-INDEX.md
**/NEW-CHAT-PROMPT.md

#    Scratch exercises and internal procedure notes
01_SIEM-Detection/scripts/
01_SIEM-Detection/procedures/

#    Raw, unprocessed session captures and the stray duplicate folder
00_parrot-hardening/Screenshots/raw-session-captures-*/
01_SIEM-Detection/01_SIEM-Detection/

# 5) OS cruft and anything credential-shaped.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.key
*.pem
*secret*
*credential*
